        {
          "type": "note",
          "tone": "warning",
          "title": "Greeting gotchas",
          "text": "- Bonjour is the safe choice all day; switch to bonsoir in the evening. Bonne nuit is only for going to bed, never a greeting.\n- Salut works for both hello and goodbye, but only with friends (informal).\n- Use vous (and Comment allez-vous ?) with strangers, older people and in formal situations; use tu with friends, family and children.\n- Enchanté is written enchantée if you are a woman. It sounds the same.\n- Ça va ? is both the question and the answer: Ça va ? — Ça va, et toi ?"
        },
